# TaskFlow 🚀

TaskFlow is a full-stack project management and collaboration platform inspired by Trello and Asana.

## Features

* User Authentication
* Project Creation & Management
* Task Creation, Editing & Deletion
* Task Assignment
* Task Priorities
* Due Dates
* Kanban Board (Todo, In Progress, Done)
* Team Management
* Search & Filter Tasks
* Dashboard Statistics
* Real-time Updates using Socket.IO
* JSON-based Data Persistence

## Tech Stack

### Frontend

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* Socket.IO

### Storage

* JSON File Storage

## Installation

```bash
npm install
node server/server.js
```

Open:

https://taskflow-backend-tmc5.onrender.com

